Phase 2:
 Implementation of the Pure Ada Driver
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
To keep the existing concurrent background task structure safe,
 encapsulate this entire bit-bang routine inside a Thread-Safe Protected Object which will prevent other modules from interrupting a transmission mid-byte.
\end_layout

